<title>ITALY: BOXING-ITALY'S PARISI RETAINS WBO SUPER-LIGHT TITLE.</title>
<headline>BOXING-ITALY'S PARISI RETAINS WBO SUPER-LIGHT TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-10-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's Giovanni Parisi retained his World Boxing Organisation super-lightweight title on Saturday when he stopped Spain's Sergio Rey after two minutes and three seconds of the fourth round.</p>
</text>
